    kind: work_item  # d321
    title: "kotlin and scala never resolve a static receiver through their implicitly-imported packages, so 22 of 186 kotlin rows and 57 of 184 scala rows are unreachable -- INV-suril's shape, with the receiver DROPPED rather than kept"  # d321
    status: todo_hard  # d321
    priority: 2  # d321
    parent:  # d321
    tags:  # d321
    - taint  # d321
    - catalogue  # d321
