  message: "CORRECTION 2026-09-23 to my note above: re-kinding the JVM statics would NOT silence the 76 sbt sites. unknown_receiver_scope does not read kind, and its caveat still attaches (verified by reading, per the INV-zikab panel's soundness seat; not re-run). What is lost is their boundary-scoped naming, a precision loss, not the caveat. This item stays a prerequisite of the JVM re-kind on precision grounds."  # 2515
